# --- Optional: real Metasploit exploitation (self-hosted, opt-in) ---
# MOVED OUT of the core production lock (P1-H3 remediation): pymetasploit3 has an
# unresolved advisory (PYSEC-2026-500, no upstream fix) and is only needed when
# RECONX_REAL_EXPLOIT=true with a reachable msfrpcd. app.metasploit imports it
# lazily and degrades cleanly when absent, so the default safe-probe build does
# NOT ship it. Operators who opt into real exploitation install the separately
# pinned lock: `pip install --require-hashes -r requirements-optional.txt`.
